request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true. --single

single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/commands.test.ts  (Added a `clear` command that removes completed todos. The Todo type stores completion in `done` (it has no `completed` field), so I treated `done === true` as 'completed'. Changes: added a `{ kind: 'clear' }` Command variant, a pure `clear()` function, parsing for `clear` in parseArgs, and a `clear` case in run() that saves the filtered list and returns `Cleared N`. Added tests for clear() and for running it against a file. Existing tests are untouched except for one added assertion in the parseArgs test.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 12/12 tests pass). The clear command removes completed (done === true) todos and reports how many it removed.)

